  "interpretation_note": "The rho=0.86 is extraordinarily high for a financial signal. This almost certainly reflects intraday momentum: option flow in the first 30 min tracks the price direction of the first 30 min, and intraday momentum persists into the rest-of-day. This is not an option-flow-leads-price effect (H58 as designed) but a direction-continuation effect. To isolate true option-flow prediction, one would need to measure flow BEFORE the open or compare flow vs underlying direction divergences."
